= Internal Factions of the <span style="color: var(--sfio);">**SFIO**</span>

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Gauche Révolutionnaire, or Revolutionary Left, is an anti-Stalinist revolutionary leftist tendency with Trotskyist and anarchist influences that supports pacifism and the revolutionary restructuring of society.">Gauche Révolutionnaire</span>!} strength: [+ revolutionary_left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ revolutionary_left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Bataille Socialiste, or Socialist Battle, supports cooperation with the PCF, militant anti-fascism at home and abroad, and radical restructuring of society.">Bataille Socialiste</span>!} strength: [+ socialist_battle_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ socialist_battle_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Center consists of Center Marxists, with a position between reform and revolution between reform and revolution, as well as de fact reformists who have accomodated to the party's center.">Centre</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

[? if pacifist_seen: <span class="tooltip-text" title="The Pacifists of the SFIO believe in avoiding war at all costs, even appeasement of Nazi Germany.">Pacifist</span> strength: [+ pacifist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ pacifist_dissent : dissent +]  ?]

